### Learning lab: Microsoft Sentinel REST calls used by the Shuffle workflows.
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension; copy the same requests into Shuffle's HTTP app.
### Check the Sentinel REST docs for the latest stable api-version before you record.

@tenantId = <tenant-id>
@clientId = <shuffle-app-client-id>
@clientSecret = <from-a-secret-store-never-commit>
@sub = <subscription-id>
@rg = rg-soc-lab
@ws = law-soc-lab
@apiVersion = 2024-03-01
@base = https://management.azure.com/subscriptions/{{sub}}/resourceGroups/{{rg}}/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/{{ws}}/providers/Microsoft.SecurityInsights

### 1. Get a token (client credentials)
# @name token
POST https://login.microsoftonline.com/{{tenantId}}/oauth2/v2.0/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&scope=https%3A%2F%2Fmanagement.azure.com%2F.default

### 2. List New incidents
# @name list
GET {{base}}/incidents?api-version={{apiVersion}}&$filter=properties/status eq 'New'&$orderby=properties/createdTimeUtc desc&$top=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 3. Get one incident (for the etag)
@incidentId = <incident-name-guid>
GET {{base}}/incidents/{{incidentId}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 4. List the incident's entities (accounts, IPs, hosts, files)
POST {{base}}/incidents/{{incidentId}}/entities?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 5. Add a comment (comment id = any new GUID)
PUT {{base}}/incidents/{{incidentId}}/comments/<new-guid>?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "properties": { "message": "Case #<n> opened in TheHive by Shuffle (learning lab)." } }

### 6. Set status Active (send the etag and the required fields from step 3)
PUT {{base}}/incidents/{{incidentId}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "etag": "<etag-from-step-3>",
  "properties": { "title": "<title-from-step-3>", "severity": "<severity-from-step-3>", "status": "Active" }
}

### 7. Close as true positive
PUT {{base}}/incidents/{{incidentId}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "etag": "<etag-from-a-fresh-get>",
  "properties": {
    "title": "<title>",
    "severity": "<severity>",
    "status": "Closed",
    "classification": "TruePositive",
    "classificationReason": "SuspiciousActivity",
    "classificationComment": "Closed from TheHive case #<n> (learning lab)."
  }
}
